<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling gained on the dollar and pound sterling, the central Bank of Tanzania (B0T) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The BoT said the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 625.0266 compared to Wednesday's 625.4127. Against the pound, it exchanged at 1047.9228 compared to Wednesday's rate of 1048.2864.</p>
